### Prototype - List templates
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/prototype/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Prototype - Get template
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/prototype/templates/saas-landing
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Prototype - Template preview (public)
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/prototype/templates/saas-landing/preview

### Prototype - Template thumbnail (public)
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/prototype/templates/saas-landing/thumbnail

### Prototype - Template asset (public)
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/prototype/templates/saas-landing/assets/template.html

### Prototype - List design systems
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/prototype/design-systems
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Prototype - Get design system
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/prototype/design-systems/linear
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Prototype - Design system preview (public)
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/prototype/design-systems/linear/preview

### Prototype - Run NDJSON pipeline
POST {{apiRoot}}/api/prototype/run
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"template_id": "saas-landing",
	"design_system_id": "linear",
	"brief": "Build a focused landing page for an AI code review tool.",
	"discovery": {
		"audience": "engineering managers",
		"cta": "Start free trial"
	}
}

### Prototype - Fetch URL proxy
GET {{apiRoot}}/api/prototype/fetch-url?url=https://example.com
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
